  "CHOOSE FAILURE MODE": "IZBERITE NAČIN NAPAKE",
  "Choose NONE to run all three steps, or FAIL AT 2 / 3 to force a failure and watch the completed steps get compensated on-chain. FAIL AT 1 fails before any transaction is sent, so there is nothing to compensate. Then click EXECUTE FLOW.": "Izberite BREZ, da izvedete vse tri korake, ali NAPAKA PRI 2 / 3, da izsilite napako in opazujete, kako se dokončani koraki kompenzirajo na verigi. NAPAKA PRI 1 spodleti, preden se pošlje katera koli transakcija, zato ni česa kompenzirati. Nato kliknite IZVEDI POTEK.",
  "WATCH & VERIFY": "OPAZUJTE IN PREVERITE",
  "Watch the step panel and the TOKEN ACCOUNTS balances. Every signature links to Solscan for independent verification.": "Opazujte ploščo korakov in stanja v razdelku RAČUNI ŽETONOV. Vsak podpis vodi na Solscan za neodvisno preverjanje.",
  "DOWNLOAD THE LOG": "PRENESITE DNEVNIK",
  "Every run is saved in this browser and survives a refresh. Click DOWNLOAD LOG for a text record or DOWNLOAD CSV for a spreadsheet; CLEAR removes the saved runs.": "Vsak zagon se shrani v tem brskalniku in ostane tudi po osvežitvi. Kliknite PRENESI DNEVNIK za besedilni zapis ali PRENESI CSV za preglednico; POČISTI odstrani shranjene zagone.",
  "If a step shows a retry or waiting message, do not click or refresh — the engine checks transaction status and recovers on its own. Keep the Phantom panel open during a run; Phantom locks itself after about 15 minutes of inactivity.": "Če korak prikaže sporočilo o ponovnem poskusu ali čakanju, ne klikajte in ne osvežujte — pogon preveri stanje transakcije in se sam obnovi. Med zagonom imejte ploščo Phantom odprto; Phantom se zaklene po približno 15 minutah nedejavnosti.",
  "WALLET": "DENARNICA",
  "SETUP": "NASTAVITEV",
  "FAILURE INJECTION": "VNAŠANJE NAPAK",
  "RUN": "ZAGON",
  "RUN LOG": "DNEVNIK ZAGONOV",
