  "PAY": "PLAČAJ",
  "Generate a payment order in three steps: choose the service and amount, choose how you want to pay, and get the exact payment details with your order number.": "Ustvarite plačilni nalog v treh korakih: izberite storitev in znesek, izberite način plačila in prejmite natančne podatke za plačilo s številko naročila.",
  "01 — SERVICE & AMOUNT": "01 — STORITEV IN ZNESEK",
  "Service": "Storitev",
  "Project amount": "Znesek projekta",
  "Currency": "Valuta",
  "Deposit and milestone percentages are set in your written agreement — use the split that matches your quote.": "Odstotki predujma in mejnikov so določeni v vaši pisni pogodbi — uporabite razdelitev, ki ustreza vaši ponudbi.",
  "Customer service (optional)": "Služba za stranke (neobvezno)",
  "If one of our customer service staff assisted you, type their name here so we can credit them.": "Če vam je pomagal kdo iz naše službe za stranke, tukaj vpišite njegovo ime, da mu to lahko pripišemo.",
